  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\np + p% of 99 = 99 + 99% of p\n\n⇒ p + (p × 99)/100 = 99 + (99 × p)/100\n\n⇒ p = 99\n\nNow, (p + 51)% of 928 + 72\n\n⇒ (99 + 51)% of 928 + 72\n\n⇒ 150% of 928 +72\n\n⇒ 1392 + 72\n\n⇒ 1464\n\n**∴ Correct answer is 1464.**",
